=== Simulation Summary ===========================================
Backend(后端)        : cupy [NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090] | dtype=fp32  # 计算设备与精度
Grid(网格)           : Nx=512, Ny=512, Nt=384 | Lx=8.000e-03 m, Ly=8.000e-03 m, Twin=9.600e-13 s  # 时空采样规模
Steps(z步进)         : z_max=1.3 m, dz=1.000e-04 m | AutoSubstep=ON  (dz_min=2.500e-05 m, grow×1.5)  # 传播步长控制
Safety(稳定性)       : mode=ON | precheck_kerr=OFF max_iter=0  # 数值安全设置
FocusWin(焦区加密)   : ON  center=0.950 m halfwidth=0.1 m dz_focus=5.000e-05 m  # 焦点附近细步长
Thresholds(阈值)      : lin_phase≤0.8, alpha·dz≤0.2, kerr_phase≤0.3, Imax_growth≤50%  # 自适应/回退判据
Linear(线性传播)      : model=bk_nee | factorize=OFF | chunk_t=8  # 线性算子设置
Lens(透镜)           : thin-lens (center ω) | f=0.950 m | lens_chunk_t=0  # 聚焦模型
Beam(入射光束)       : λ0=8.000e-07 m n0=1.00027 w0=1.979e-03 m τ_FWHM=1.200e-13 s  # 初始脉冲参数
Energy(能量)         : config=0 J | actual(after norm)=2.171e-03 J | E0_peak=1.443e+09 V/m  # 目标与归一化
P0_peak(峰值功率)    : 1.700e+10 W  # 与 energy_J 二选一
Repetition(重频)      : f_rep=1.000e+03 Hz | pulses=1  # 脉冲序列
Kerr(克尔效应)       : ON   n2=7.800e-24 m^2/W | P_cr≈1.214e+10 W  # 自聚焦关键参数
Self-steep.(自陡峭)   : ON   method=tdiff  chunk_px=65536  # 脉冲前沿陡化
Raman       : ON  f_R=0.15  n_R=2.300e-23 m^2/W  model=rot_sinexp  T2=8.000e-11 s  T_R=8.400e-12 s  method=iir  chunk_px=65536
  Note       : rot_sinexp uses explicit n_R for phase/absorption; f_R is ignored in phase channel.
  Absorption(吸收)   : ON   scheme=conv_deriv  # 拉曼吸收模型
FinalEffective(最终生效参数):
  - ionization.time_mode=full  integrator=rk4
  - propagation.auto_substep=True  dz=1.000e-04 m  dz_focus=5.000e-05 m
  - beam.energy_J=null  P0_peak=1.700e+10 W  norm_source=P0_peak
Ionization(电离)      : SPECIES(2)  caps: W≤1.000e+19 s^-1, I≤1.000e+19 W/m^2  expects=—  # 电离输入域
  Species(组分)      :
    - N2     rate=POPRUZHENKO_ATOM_I_LUT fraction=0.800, expects=—
    - O2     rate=POPRUZHENKO_ATOM_I_LUT fraction=0.200, expects=—
  TimeMode(时间近似) : FULL  integrator=RK4  # 全时域积分
  Drude ν_ei(碰撞频) : 0 s^-1
  Drude/IB(等离子体) : β_rec=0 m^3/s  σ_ib=0 m^2  # 复合与吸收
EnergyGuard(能量守护): ON  every=50 skip-first=5× | blowup×50  # 异常能量监测
Diagnostics(诊断输出): extra=ON   # 扩展诊断开关
